Subject: observation-level (or unit-level) random effects with INLA
Message-ID: <Iiu3AKbGjiM.T15NaTiGjzoJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/r-inla-discussion-group/c/Iiu3AKbGjiM/m/T15NaTiGjzoJ>
